    "body": "Spawned from #601 (Ari-program campaign). #601 records `sentencepiece-unigram` as a recognized-but-rejected family in the versioned tokenizer-adapter registry (`hf_bpe::adapter_constructor` refuses it by name via `SourceIngestKind::UnknownTokenizerAdapter`); this issue implements a real SentencePiece/Unigram adapter as a new `(family, version)` registry entry with its own `TokenizerAdapter` policy derivation and differential source fixtures. Scope mirrors #601: no change to the byte-level BPE family, the legacy llama2.c tokenizer, or any κ-pinned artifact; an unsupported SentencePiece feature set must fail closed by name, never be approximated. PRECONDITION (from #601's own scope): a chosen source snapshot with pinned revision and license record — do not start without one. Filed unassigned per board rules.",
